<section class="public-page"><div class="public-hero"><div class="site-container"><span class="public-kicker"><i class="fa-solid fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i> Technical expertise</span><h1>Find technical help when a part is only <span>half the solution.</span></h1><p>Search the technician/service-provider concept by skill, location and availability so industrial requirements can connect parts with field expertise.</p><div class="public-actions"><a class="public-button" href="~/Account/Register.aspx" runat="server">Join the Portal</a><a class="public-button orange" href="~/Public/Emergency.aspx" runat="server">Emergency Support Path</a></div></div></div>
<section class="public-section"><div class="site-container"><div class="public-section-head"><span class="public-kicker">Technician discovery</span><h2>Search by practical service criteria.</h2></div><div class="public-grid"><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i></div><h3>Electrical service</h3><p>Discover technicians represented as having industrial electrical and control-system skills.</p></article><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-droplet"></i></div><h3>Hydraulic service</h3><p>Find technicians represented as working with pumps, valves and hydraulic systems.</p></article><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gears"></i></div><h3>Mechanical service</h3><p>Connect requirements with mechanical maintenance and machine service skills.</p></article><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i></div><h3>Location</h3><p>Use location as a discovery factor for field-service requirements.</p></article><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i></div><h3>Availability</h3><p>Represent whether a technician is available for a requested service window.</p></article><article class="public-card"><div class="public-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i></div><h3>Service history</h3><p>Support future service-history records as the role-based application develops.</p></article></div></div></section>
